WEBVTT

01:41.530 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.580 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 22]

01:49.350 --> 01:50.840
That's already going against fate.

01:51.789 --> 01:53.110
If you wish to enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

01:53.710 --> 01:55.400
and attain instant ascension,

01:56.229 --> 01:58.070
you must bear the risks that come with it.

01:58.280 --> 01:59.120
Then my master...

02:01.760 --> 02:03.040
That's your master, right?

02:14.520 --> 02:15.680
It's indeed Master's technique.

02:16.110 --> 02:17.380
Master did use the Soul Control Technique

02:17.470 --> 02:18.520
to reside in Bai's body.

02:29.030 --> 02:29.840
That woman

02:30.400 --> 02:32.240
should be too preoccupied to fight your master now.

02:33.800 --> 02:34.280
Girl,

02:35.400 --> 02:36.680
you made it out of the Treasure Cave.

02:37.430 --> 02:39.470
This is the final test of the trial.

02:41.410 --> 02:42.079
Let's go.

03:06.030 --> 03:06.910
That's…

03:07.680 --> 03:08.750
Senior Lu Yun?

03:10.310 --> 03:11.840
This cave is called the Memory Cave.

03:10.370 --> 03:12.030
[The Memory Cave, Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

03:12.510 --> 03:14.400
Those who pass the trial of Heavenly Meridian Mountain

03:14.840 --> 03:16.680
will leave their obsessions

03:17.190 --> 03:18.190
here.

03:19.960 --> 03:21.960
I suppose this is the bit of amusement Dun Tian sought

03:23.000 --> 03:24.680
in exchange for opening the Mountain.

03:26.480 --> 03:28.600
Dun Tian was so great. I thought he did this

03:28.870 --> 03:30.260
to support the younger generations.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.310
If it were just about offering support,

03:33.310 --> 03:35.630
throwing down some immortal herbs and pills

03:35.880 --> 03:36.880
would be enough.

03:37.590 --> 03:38.560
Just to see

03:38.560 --> 03:39.520
other people's memories?

03:40.360 --> 03:41.520
Wouldn't that be too boring?

03:42.150 --> 03:43.840
But immortals live too long,

03:44.280 --> 03:45.910
and the Immortal Realm is forever the same.

03:46.280 --> 03:47.280
After a while,

03:48.310 --> 03:49.400
it all becomes unbearably dull.

03:50.000 --> 03:51.240
So I followed Dun Tian

03:51.240 --> 03:53.030
to observe this once-in-nineteen-years trial

03:53.590 --> 03:54.430
and watch them

03:55.079 --> 03:55.690
leave behind

03:56.150 --> 03:57.800
memories of joy or sorrow.

03:58.520 --> 03:59.390
Only then did I realize

04:01.000 --> 04:02.240
that the mortal world

04:03.000 --> 04:04.150
holds the most fascinating things.

04:05.680 --> 04:07.280
So even those who have entered the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

04:07.310 --> 04:08.240
are also like this.

04:09.140 --> 04:10.370
It seems that every heart

04:10.400 --> 04:11.280
carries its own desires.

04:21.430 --> 04:24.680
♫In March, we make rice milk♫

04:24.950 --> 04:27.870
♫And bring it to our daughter for a taste♫

04:28.060 --> 04:30.860
[Rong Yao, Dun Tian's Wife]

04:28.120 --> 04:31.390
♫In April, we make wine♫

04:31.750 --> 04:37.870
♫A single day without it feels all wrong♫

04:39.720 --> 04:40.310
Alright,

04:40.800 --> 04:41.390
it's ready!

04:41.920 --> 04:43.000
It smells so good!

04:45.520 --> 04:46.600
Mom made chicken drumsticks.

04:46.630 --> 04:47.720
They smell delicious!

04:48.270 --> 04:48.870
Honey,

04:49.240 --> 04:49.870
time to eat.

04:52.680 --> 04:53.190
Dad,

04:53.390 --> 04:54.040
come quickly,

04:54.060 --> 04:55.590
or I'll eat all the drumsticks!

04:56.040 --> 04:56.600
Sit down.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.600
Whose obsession is this?

05:00.430 --> 05:01.070
Dun Tian's.

05:02.160 --> 05:03.750
Dun Tian's obsession

05:04.120 --> 05:05.310
was his wife and daughters?

05:06.630 --> 05:07.240
Indeed.

05:11.000 --> 05:13.370
Chang'e must regret stealing the spiritual medicine,

05:13.870 --> 05:15.920
gazing at the blue sky night after night with a heavy heart.

05:16.870 --> 05:18.000
Did he regret it deeply?

05:18.920 --> 05:20.040
Back then, Dun Tian

05:20.480 --> 05:21.560
glimpsed the secrets of fate.

05:22.390 --> 05:24.920
He knew that to attain ascension,

05:25.560 --> 05:27.680
he had to sever all worldly attachments,

05:28.040 --> 05:29.310
slay the Mortal-Demon Lord,

05:29.830 --> 05:31.000
and prove his worth for immortality.

05:31.920 --> 05:32.560
So,

05:32.560 --> 05:33.830
in his final battle...

05:35.630 --> 05:36.480
Dun Tian!

05:37.100 --> 05:38.930
Save our children!

05:38.950 --> 05:40.150
Dun Tian!

05:41.050 --> 05:42.210
He didn't save

05:42.240 --> 05:43.390
his wife, Rong Yao,

05:43.390 --> 05:44.390
and their two daughters.

05:44.950 --> 05:45.680
In the end,

05:46.140 --> 05:47.380
he ascended to the Immortal Realm,

05:48.159 --> 05:49.159
but his wife and daughters

05:49.240 --> 05:50.830
suffered tragic deaths.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.680
Of course, he regretted it.

05:53.750 --> 05:54.920
The loss outweighed the gain.

05:55.750 --> 05:57.120
A happy family

05:57.430 --> 05:58.680
should've been what he pursued.

05:59.320 --> 06:00.570
We only fight evil to protect

06:00.600 --> 06:01.680
our family, don't we?

06:02.070 --> 06:03.600
To attain the hollow ascension,

06:03.870 --> 06:05.600
he cast away what was most precious

06:06.390 --> 06:08.000
and then regretted it.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.470
Wasn't it all for nothing

06:09.660 --> 06:10.430
but self-inflicted misery?

06:12.000 --> 06:13.040
It's all over now.

06:13.870 --> 06:14.950
What's done is done.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.040
Decades ago,

06:17.480 --> 06:18.870
a dark force invaded the Celestial Palace

06:18.890 --> 06:19.770
for the Heavenly Book.

06:20.390 --> 06:21.920
Dun Tian fought fiercely against it

06:21.950 --> 06:23.000
and unfortunately perished.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.310
Now, in the whole universe,

06:27.070 --> 06:28.410
only this Memory Cave

06:29.240 --> 06:30.920
holds traces of him.

06:37.310 --> 06:38.430
Take this spiritual light

06:39.040 --> 06:40.040
and leave your obsession

06:40.430 --> 06:41.680
here as well.

06:42.159 --> 06:42.680
Then,

06:43.310 --> 06:44.260
the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

06:44.830 --> 06:45.870
will open for you.

06:54.000 --> 06:54.720
May I ask

06:55.770 --> 06:57.330
where my master's obsession is?

06:58.240 --> 06:59.430
I want to see it.

07:04.800 --> 07:06.430
Your master entered the Black Pool back then.

07:07.560 --> 07:08.870
His obsession is not here.

07:10.040 --> 07:10.920
The Black Pool?

07:12.160 --> 07:13.570
Once you enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool,

07:14.000 --> 07:14.920
you'll understand.

07:15.630 --> 07:17.430
The Pool is divided into two: one white and one black.

07:18.040 --> 07:18.680
The White Pool

07:19.120 --> 07:20.240
strengthens one's cultivation,

07:20.630 --> 07:22.720
allowing for steady and righteous progress,

07:23.270 --> 07:24.070
while the Black Pool

07:24.430 --> 07:25.600
grants rapid advancement

07:26.360 --> 07:27.950
at the cost of awakening one's inner demons.

07:29.070 --> 07:29.830
Your master

07:31.040 --> 07:32.360
chose the Black Pool.

07:33.120 --> 07:35.040
So when Heavenly Meridian Mountain trembled,

07:35.630 --> 07:36.240
his obsession

07:36.240 --> 07:37.430
was lost to the unknown.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.190
It's getting late.

07:45.430 --> 07:46.390
I should head back.

07:48.190 --> 07:48.720
Girl,

07:49.870 --> 07:50.830
please

07:51.270 --> 07:52.720
tell that drunkard brother of mine

07:53.750 --> 07:55.040
to drink less.

07:56.680 --> 07:57.240
After all,

07:57.950 --> 07:59.670
he's my only family left.

08:03.430 --> 08:04.360
I'll pass on your message.

08:42.720 --> 08:43.440
So,

08:44.390 --> 08:46.000
all my memories with Master…

08:47.320 --> 08:49.200
have become my obsession.

08:51.360 --> 08:53.550
I wonder what Master's obsession is.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.790
Perhaps it's Grandmaster.

09:01.030 --> 09:02.550
The Marrow-Cleansing Pool is just ahead.

09:03.480 --> 09:04.270
Once I enter,

09:04.550 --> 09:05.870
I'll form my Golden Core

09:06.670 --> 09:08.030
and can leave Mount Wester.

09:09.870 --> 09:11.080
I wonder if after that,

09:11.750 --> 09:13.150
Master will

09:14.120 --> 09:15.670
occasionally think of me.

09:18.480 --> 09:19.150
Xue Ranran,

09:19.600 --> 09:20.390
don't overthink it.

09:21.750 --> 09:22.600
After completing your training,

09:22.960 --> 09:24.480
go back and bid Master a proper farewell.

09:25.030 --> 09:26.320
You can still visit him during holidays

09:26.480 --> 09:27.790
to pay your respects.

09:28.720 --> 09:29.670
You'll surely see him again.

09:39.290 --> 09:41.540
[Marrow-Cleansing Pool, Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

09:39.500 --> 09:41.240
So this is the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

09:48.670 --> 09:49.910
The Black Pool

09:50.750 --> 09:52.280
truly holds immense spiritual power,

09:53.240 --> 09:54.790
but it's also filled with a lot of resentment.

09:56.030 --> 09:57.200
Any righteous cultivator

09:57.220 --> 09:58.340
would surely choose the White Pool.

09:59.480 --> 10:01.150
Why did Master choose the Black Pool?

10:02.360 --> 10:03.690
Let go of the past.

10:04.390 --> 10:05.630
Master is fine.

10:07.030 --> 10:07.630
Now,

10:08.270 --> 10:09.750
you should make your choice.

10:59.630 --> 11:00.600
I've formed my Golden Core.

11:01.360 --> 11:02.870
I'm a Golden Core cultivator now!

11:17.840 --> 11:18.440
Master!

11:20.390 --> 11:21.200
Mu Qingge!

11:23.360 --> 11:24.030
Don't!

11:36.320 --> 11:37.390
Did I just see…

11:37.870 --> 11:38.720
Master?

11:39.270 --> 11:40.870
Was that a memory from my past life

11:41.240 --> 11:42.270
or from Ling Xiao?

11:43.320 --> 11:44.720
And why was Master in it?

12:05.870 --> 12:06.840
My cultivation

12:07.600 --> 12:09.080
has dropped to the early Golden Core stage.

12:10.260 --> 12:10.930
She…

12:12.000 --> 12:13.910
She entered the Marrow-Cleansing Pool!

12:17.790 --> 12:19.000
It's that demon, Gui Baqian?

12:27.320 --> 12:28.120
I finally made it

12:28.120 --> 12:29.200
to the Marrow-Cleansing Pool,

12:29.600 --> 12:30.270
but its power

12:30.270 --> 12:31.630
has been mostly taken by you.

12:31.840 --> 12:32.320
Girl,

12:32.390 --> 12:33.320
do you have a death wish?

12:33.600 --> 12:34.360
Stop right now!

12:34.750 --> 12:36.270
I followed the rules of Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

12:36.510 --> 12:37.790
You barged in using dark magic,

12:38.120 --> 12:39.240
yet you're asking me to stop.

12:39.270 --> 12:39.960
Sovereign Wei,

12:40.510 --> 12:41.720
you're so brazen.

12:43.720 --> 12:45.120
How did you figure it out?

12:45.630 --> 12:47.030
When I met the blood-sucking vines,

12:47.360 --> 12:48.480
I knew that Gui Baqian

12:48.480 --> 12:49.320
was a demon.

12:49.830 --> 12:50.480
Few demons

12:50.510 --> 12:51.600
would dare sneak into

12:51.600 --> 12:52.270
Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

12:52.720 --> 12:53.840
And even fewer

12:53.870 --> 12:54.910
have lost their cultivation

12:55.150 --> 12:56.320
and are desperate to recover it.

12:57.030 --> 12:58.440
You meet all these criteria, Sovereign Wei.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.550
It wasn't hard to guess.

13:13.280 --> 13:14.450
I hoped to use the Pool

13:14.480 --> 13:15.440
to reach the Transcendence Realm,

13:16.030 --> 13:17.390
but the little power left has only

13:17.600 --> 13:19.270
brought me back to the peak of the Nascent Soul Realm.

13:19.790 --> 13:20.360
Xue Ranran,

13:20.790 --> 13:21.550
I'll kill you right now

13:21.870 --> 13:22.510
and take your power!

13:27.670 --> 13:29.320
Let's see how long you can hold me off!

13:29.670 --> 13:30.440
It doesn't need to be long.

13:31.200 --> 13:32.150
The trial is over.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.080
What's going on?

13:48.550 --> 13:49.670
Why is everyone back?

13:50.150 --> 13:51.320
Someone entered the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

13:51.630 --> 13:52.480
The trial is over.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.670
Who entered the Pool?

13:55.600 --> 13:56.150
Ranran!

13:56.240 --> 13:57.000
-Ranran!
-Ranran!

13:58.200 --> 13:58.750
Ranran,

13:58.960 --> 14:00.030
you really made it.

14:00.440 --> 14:01.670
You have the spiritual mark on your forehead.

14:02.120 --> 14:03.360
You really entered the Pool.

14:05.240 --> 14:06.200
We'll talk about that later.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.150
Be careful of Wei Jiu.

14:07.630 --> 14:08.230
Wei Jiu?

14:10.460 --> 14:11.170
Why is that demon Wei Jiu

14:11.200 --> 14:12.270
here in Heavenly Meridian Mountain?

14:12.390 --> 14:13.000
He has the Pool's

14:13.000 --> 14:14.000
spiritual mark on his forehead too.

14:14.630 --> 14:15.200
What's going on?

14:15.790 --> 14:17.390
Wei Jiu used dark magic to disguise himself as Gui Baqian,

14:17.840 --> 14:18.840
then forced his way into the Pool,

14:18.870 --> 14:19.790
and took a part of its power.

14:20.320 --> 14:21.870
Guys, let's take him down together!

14:27.910 --> 14:28.720
Pathetic fools.

14:32.270 --> 14:32.720
Ranran.

14:32.820 --> 14:33.790
You've formed your Golden Core.

14:34.030 --> 14:34.670
That's great!

14:35.870 --> 14:36.480
Mu Qingge,

14:36.890 --> 14:37.690
don't just watch!

14:37.720 --> 14:38.480
Help me!

14:40.030 --> 14:41.030
Demonic scum,

14:41.550 --> 14:42.720
everyone wants to kill you.

14:43.150 --> 14:44.120
Why should I help you?

14:46.060 --> 14:47.750
Have you forgotten about the Resentment Liquid?

14:48.750 --> 14:49.980
Let me remind you.

14:54.870 --> 14:56.000
You've broken free of it?

14:56.360 --> 14:56.960
Yeah.

14:57.910 --> 14:59.870
Sovereign Wei, your chances of survival are slim.

15:00.480 --> 15:01.510
If you want to live,

15:01.910 --> 15:03.270
I'm afraid there's only one way:

15:05.030 --> 15:05.720
beg me.

15:05.960 --> 15:06.750
Dream on!

15:07.320 --> 15:08.670
If you said that in your past life,

15:08.670 --> 15:09.480
it'd make some sense.

15:09.630 --> 15:10.670
But in this life?

15:11.240 --> 15:12.480
Why the hell should I beg you?

15:12.960 --> 15:13.720
Master Mu,

15:13.910 --> 15:15.360
how can you try to collude with this demon?

15:16.440 --> 15:16.910
Forget it.

15:17.630 --> 15:18.750
It was just for amusement anyway.

15:22.360 --> 15:24.000
You've gained power from the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.630
Congratulations.

15:30.630 --> 15:32.110
The Imperial Heaven-Reversing Seal!

15:32.270 --> 15:33.230
It's an imperial artifact.

15:33.680 --> 15:34.880
The Crown Prince actually

15:34.910 --> 15:35.510
lent it to you.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.750
Today, I'll use this artifact

15:38.440 --> 15:39.630
to exact my revenge!

15:42.910 --> 15:43.550
Mu Qingge!

15:43.960 --> 15:44.750
What are you going to do?

15:45.080 --> 15:46.360
You're all dead!

15:53.670 --> 15:54.840
Why won't the Seal kill?

15:55.480 --> 15:56.600
What went wrong?

16:24.440 --> 16:25.270
Congratulations, Your Highness.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.030
The Heaven-Reversing Seal

16:27.240 --> 16:29.030
has shattered the celestial rocks in Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.320
The last

16:30.480 --> 16:31.320
of the Four-Way Waterways

16:31.600 --> 16:32.470
has now been cleared.

16:33.000 --> 16:33.480
Soon,

16:33.750 --> 16:35.080
the waters will flow into the capital.

16:36.030 --> 16:38.510
Clearing the waterway on the Heavenly Ones' sacred land

16:39.080 --> 16:40.440
was no easy feat.

16:42.940 --> 16:44.490
I must thank her for her help.

16:54.150 --> 16:55.550
Master Mu, you must be mistaken.

16:56.030 --> 16:56.720
Imperial artifacts

16:56.720 --> 16:58.030
can only be activated by imperial blood.

16:58.510 --> 16:59.390
Young Master Yu would never

16:59.390 --> 17:00.200
let you use it to harm people.

17:01.870 --> 17:04.000
You tried to kill us but only embarrassed yourself.

17:04.790 --> 17:05.849
How amusing.

17:06.410 --> 17:07.540
Your reputation among the Heavenly Ones

17:07.640 --> 17:09.069
is as good as ruined.

17:09.819 --> 17:10.380
But

17:10.880 --> 17:12.310
I can offer you a way out.

17:13.000 --> 17:14.829
Kill everyone here for me,

17:16.230 --> 17:16.829
and I'll keep

17:17.240 --> 17:18.109
your secret safe.

17:18.750 --> 17:20.270
I prefer to solve this myself.

17:21.550 --> 17:22.069
Watch out!

17:42.920 --> 17:43.830
Devourer Bugs!

17:44.790 --> 17:45.820
Mu Qingge, you're insane

17:45.920 --> 17:46.830
for raising these cursed things!

17:52.880 --> 17:53.560
Sovereign Wei,

17:54.440 --> 17:55.680
you and everyone here

17:55.920 --> 17:56.880
have to die today!

17:57.720 --> 17:58.880
That's the safest way

17:58.880 --> 17:59.960
to keep a secret!

18:10.790 --> 18:11.790
Mu Qingge actually ran away.

18:19.350 --> 18:20.750
Devourer Bugs feed on spiritual power.

18:21.240 --> 18:22.440
Even ascended immortals

18:23.000 --> 18:24.240
can't resist so many of them.

18:24.510 --> 18:25.110
Scatter!

18:26.030 --> 18:27.420
Take these Escape Talismans!

18:27.550 --> 18:28.720
Once I distract the Devourer Bugs,

18:29.000 --> 18:30.160
you'll activate them

18:30.270 --> 18:31.070
and get down the mountain!

18:31.240 --> 18:32.240
Distract the Devourer Bugs?

18:32.510 --> 18:33.510
How will you escape?

18:33.790 --> 18:34.790
I've formed my Golden Core.

18:35.000 --> 18:35.640
I'll find a way.

18:35.790 --> 18:36.270
Run!

18:36.590 --> 18:37.480
We're not leaving!

18:45.750 --> 18:46.400
Master?

18:47.160 --> 18:47.740
Go!

18:48.720 --> 18:49.480
It's really you!

18:50.310 --> 18:50.880
Jump into the water!

19:12.500 --> 19:15.770
[The foot of Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

19:20.920 --> 19:22.830
The spiritual light in Heavenly Meridian Mountain just faded.

19:23.830 --> 19:25.550
Someone has entered the Marrow-Cleansing Pool?

19:25.880 --> 19:27.240
Since the trial is over,

19:27.480 --> 19:28.680
why hasn't anyone come out?

19:30.750 --> 19:31.440
Help!

19:34.720 --> 19:35.240
Master.

19:37.070 --> 19:37.880
It's Wei Jiu.

19:38.270 --> 19:38.960
Wei Jiu?

19:39.270 --> 19:40.550
He's in Heavenly Meridian Mountain?

19:41.240 --> 19:41.920
How is that possible?

19:42.880 --> 19:43.970
Wei Jiu used dark magic

19:44.200 --> 19:45.930
to disguise himself as Gui Baqian from Lingdi Sect.

19:45.960 --> 19:46.930
He snuck into the mountain

19:47.640 --> 19:49.000
and released Devourer Bugs.

19:49.720 --> 19:50.510
Devourer Bugs?

19:50.590 --> 19:50.920
That's…

19:50.940 --> 19:52.000
Devourer Bugs? Devourer Bugs?

19:52.020 --> 19:53.100
I did everything I could

19:53.240 --> 19:54.200
to make it out alive.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.830
I'm afraid the others...

19:59.160 --> 20:00.200
What should we do?

20:01.110 --> 20:02.860
How did Wei Jiu obtain those deadly bugs?

20:03.830 --> 20:04.680
The barrier is still in place.

20:05.160 --> 20:06.440
We can't get inside to save them.

20:06.970 --> 20:08.620
W-What should we do?

20:10.660 --> 20:12.700
[Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

20:11.050 --> 20:11.640
Master,

20:11.830 --> 20:12.640
are you alright?

20:14.920 --> 20:15.440
Master,

20:15.830 --> 20:17.150
the bugs I gave you,

20:17.400 --> 20:18.310
do you find them satisfying?

20:19.880 --> 20:21.070
They got in your way,

20:21.590 --> 20:22.400
so just let those bugs

20:22.530 --> 20:23.860
send them to hell.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.270
Once everything's settled,

20:27.830 --> 20:29.110
I'll escort you back to the palace.

20:36.920 --> 20:37.400
Hurry!

20:37.830 --> 20:38.830
The Devourer Bugs will

20:38.830 --> 20:39.630
track our power here soon.

20:57.510 --> 20:58.110
Master,

20:58.750 --> 20:59.720
what is this place?

21:00.200 --> 21:01.000
You've been here before?

21:07.160 --> 21:08.160
Su Yishui?

21:10.070 --> 21:11.070
Soul Control Technique?

21:11.750 --> 21:12.960
You actually resorted to such a method

21:12.960 --> 21:13.680
to enter Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

21:15.960 --> 21:16.310
Let's go.

21:17.510 --> 21:18.590
I'm not finished yet!

21:20.160 --> 21:21.590
No wonder you were able to enter the Pool.

21:22.070 --> 21:23.640
So Su Yishui helped you cheat.

21:24.350 --> 21:24.830
Does it hurt?

21:26.640 --> 21:28.030
The Devourer Bugs drained quite a bit

21:28.030 --> 21:28.720
of your power.

21:29.300 --> 21:30.190
You're gravely injured.

21:33.200 --> 21:34.070
So what?

21:34.690 --> 21:35.280
Since we've all

21:35.310 --> 21:36.400
lost a great deal of power,

21:36.750 --> 21:37.750
why not call a temporary truce

21:37.960 --> 21:38.910
to recover first

21:39.110 --> 21:40.270
and find a way out?

21:41.070 --> 21:41.680
Fine.

21:42.240 --> 21:43.640
Break the binding spell first.

21:45.270 --> 21:46.920
Sovereign Wei, your reputation is too bad.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.440
How can I trust you so easily?

21:49.000 --> 21:49.830
End of conversation.

21:50.160 --> 21:51.000
Enjoy your solitude.

21:51.310 --> 21:51.920
Farewell.

21:52.400 --> 21:52.960
Wait.

21:55.440 --> 21:56.310
A truce it is.

21:56.880 --> 21:57.920
I'm not afraid of you anyway.

22:17.110 --> 22:18.350
You're so rough with an injured person!

22:20.030 --> 22:20.590
Master,

22:21.030 --> 22:22.350
the Devourer Bugs have damaged your meridians.

22:22.550 --> 22:24.030
Take this Meridian Repairing Pill.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.200
I'm injured too.

22:32.560 --> 22:33.360
Feel free

22:33.510 --> 22:34.400
to use these medicines.

22:35.200 --> 22:36.510
Don't treat me like a beggar.

22:37.200 --> 22:37.920
You just said

22:38.110 --> 22:39.790
the Devourer Bugs damaged the meridians.

22:40.110 --> 22:41.400
What use are these external wound medicines?

22:41.880 --> 22:43.310
There's only one Meridian Repairing Pill.

22:43.590 --> 22:44.640
It has to go to my master.

22:45.000 --> 22:46.000
You'll have to make do.

22:50.540 --> 22:51.170
What's that?

22:56.070 --> 22:56.640
Ranran,

22:57.590 --> 22:58.920
give me the pill.

23:06.680 --> 23:07.410
Wei Jiu is cunning.

23:07.440 --> 23:07.880
We can't let him live.

23:08.110 --> 23:08.880
It's better to kill him now.

23:09.400 --> 23:09.920
Su Yishui,

23:10.270 --> 23:11.000
you can't kill me!

23:11.590 --> 23:13.070
You used the Soul Control Technique to possess the White Tiger

23:13.490 --> 23:14.080
and fought Mu Qingge

23:14.110 --> 23:15.070
and the Devourer Bugs.

23:15.270 --> 23:16.030
You've been greatly weakened.

23:16.310 --> 23:17.030
If you kill me now,

23:17.160 --> 23:17.490
you…

23:17.590 --> 23:18.550
you'll suffer severe injuries.

23:21.350 --> 23:21.960
What are you doing?

23:22.550 --> 23:23.480
Is it true?

23:24.000 --> 23:24.680
Has the Soul Control Technique

23:24.920 --> 23:26.440
really weakened you so much?

23:26.680 --> 23:27.400
Of course it's true.

23:27.640 --> 23:28.350
Possessing a divine beast

23:28.610 --> 23:29.370
drains one's spiritual soul

23:29.400 --> 23:30.680
every time one practices magic.

23:31.200 --> 23:32.510
If their spiritual soul is already incomplete,

23:32.920 --> 23:33.720
it'll shorten their lifespan,

23:33.830 --> 23:34.350
causing death!

23:34.720 --> 23:35.160
Ranran,

23:35.350 --> 23:36.750
your master must be severely injured.

23:36.910 --> 23:38.590
Otherwise, he wouldn't have used illusions to hide…

23:42.070 --> 23:42.670
You trust him?

23:43.070 --> 23:44.030
I don't.

23:44.680 --> 23:46.510
It's just that we agreed to a temporary truce.

23:46.750 --> 23:47.790
I should keep my word.

23:48.310 --> 23:48.920
Moreover,

23:49.640 --> 23:50.790
your spiritual power

23:51.110 --> 23:52.640
is indeed weaker than before.

23:53.350 --> 23:54.440
Whether it's true or not,

23:54.920 --> 23:56.200
I don't want you to get hurt.

24:01.750 --> 24:02.590
If you insist,

24:02.790 --> 24:03.440
I'll drop it.

24:05.300 --> 24:06.650
But I'm truly fine.

24:07.070 --> 24:08.000
I don't need the Meridian Repairing Pill.

24:10.110 --> 24:10.830
You take it.

24:19.070 --> 24:19.680
Half for each of us.

24:31.510 --> 24:32.350
Meditate now.

25:06.920 --> 25:07.550
Master.

25:16.160 --> 25:17.680
I'll find a way to treat your injuries.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.550
Eat something first.

25:23.480 --> 25:25.270
With damaged meridians, fasting won't work.

25:25.550 --> 25:26.790
You need to eat something.

25:27.200 --> 25:28.470
The dried sweet potato is delicious.

25:40.970 --> 25:41.970
I saw a lot of vegetation

25:42.000 --> 25:42.790
outside the waterfall.

25:43.440 --> 25:44.270
There might be medicinal herbs.

25:44.640 --> 25:45.480
I'll go take a look.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.400
If you behave

25:47.640 --> 25:48.640
and don't wake my master up,

25:48.840 --> 25:49.880
I'll share some with you later.

25:55.170 --> 25:56.820
You won't take this chance to break free

25:56.930 --> 25:57.800
and hurt my master, will you?

26:00.000 --> 26:01.110
Still,

26:01.200 --> 26:01.880
better safe than sorry.

26:02.400 --> 26:03.200
Don't blame me.

26:05.930 --> 26:06.670
See you in a bit.

26:22.350 --> 26:23.200
Prajna Orchid Herb!

27:01.440 --> 27:02.400
It's mine now!

27:05.160 --> 27:06.030
So this place

27:06.350 --> 27:07.640
is the Memory Cave for those who entered

27:07.640 --> 27:08.310
the Black Pool.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.510
Master entered the Black Pool,

27:11.000 --> 27:12.200
so his obsession...

27:36.000 --> 27:36.550
Where's Ranran?

27:43.110 --> 27:44.160
She's your disciple.

27:44.310 --> 27:45.190
Why are you asking me?

27:46.070 --> 27:47.160
I'm asking you—where is Ranran?

27:48.680 --> 27:49.070
She...

27:49.720 --> 27:51.260
she said she went out to find herbs

27:51.350 --> 27:52.110
to treat your injuries.

28:14.000 --> 28:14.640
Ling Xiao,

28:15.030 --> 28:16.260
you can break this seal?

28:17.030 --> 28:18.350
The obsession on it

28:19.070 --> 28:20.200
belongs to your soul owner?

28:23.510 --> 28:24.880
I don't need a son.

28:25.550 --> 28:27.830
I need someone valuable.

28:29.480 --> 28:29.920
I…

28:31.400 --> 28:31.720
I…

28:31.880 --> 28:32.790
I'll definitely become

28:32.790 --> 28:33.640
a person of value.

28:35.960 --> 28:36.590
And you

28:37.450 --> 28:39.170
are the one-in-a-million

28:39.200 --> 28:40.600
Demon's child.

28:56.820 --> 28:57.900
I feel the Spirit Spring.

29:01.180 --> 29:02.530
Why is it Master?

29:06.110 --> 29:07.510
I saw it before.

29:09.350 --> 29:11.070
Ling Xiao's soul owner is the Demon's child.

29:12.310 --> 29:13.790
But Master is also the Demon's child.

29:15.400 --> 29:15.920
Could it be that

29:17.200 --> 29:18.640
the soul owner is Master?

29:20.460 --> 29:21.760
Everything you saw is true.

29:24.000 --> 29:24.480
It's me.

29:25.830 --> 29:27.350
I'm the one who brought calamities to the world,

29:28.270 --> 29:30.000
the one all Heavenly Ones want to kill.

29:31.400 --> 29:32.680
Is this why

29:33.240 --> 29:34.440
you want me to leave?

29:36.160 --> 29:36.680
Exactly.

29:37.790 --> 29:38.790
Now that you've seen the truth,

29:39.680 --> 29:40.270
leave Mount Wester

29:42.440 --> 29:43.440
after you go back.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.960
Who cares about the Demon's child?

29:52.440 --> 29:53.480
I've just found out—

29:53.580 --> 29:57.070
♫Who is that alone under the tree?♫

29:53.890 --> 29:54.920
the one I've been searching for

29:55.110 --> 29:55.790
is you, Master;

29:56.200 --> 29:57.830
the one who's protected me by my side since I was a child

29:58.110 --> 29:59.000
is also you;

29:58.200 --> 30:03.340
♫Stained with a light and clear glow♫

29:59.750 --> 30:01.150
in that icy spiritual sense,

30:01.510 --> 30:02.960
the one who quietly listened to me

30:03.200 --> 30:04.070
was still you.

30:03.760 --> 30:08.210
♫Repeatedly awakened from dreams by the shattered shadow of the moon♫

30:06.720 --> 30:07.510
In this world,

30:08.030 --> 30:09.590
only you truly care about me.

30:08.960 --> 30:14.470
♫Outside the mountain, longing reflected in the limpid eyes♫

30:10.440 --> 30:11.960
I don't care if you're the Demon's child.

30:12.590 --> 30:13.400
All I know is that

30:13.730 --> 30:14.560
you're the one

30:14.590 --> 30:15.720
who treats me the best in this world.

30:16.280 --> 30:19.960
♫With a gentle nudge of the night breeze, the lantern is empty♫

30:20.590 --> 30:25.810
♫Time passed can never be brought back♫

30:26.300 --> 30:31.600
♫On sleepless nights, I toast to the world and drown my sorrows♫

30:27.420 --> 30:28.900
It's all just a twist of fate.

30:30.160 --> 30:31.260
Even if I care for you,

30:31.850 --> 30:37.090
♫My lovesickness comprises only of you♫

30:31.920 --> 30:33.440
it's for the sake of that old friend of mine.

30:34.720 --> 30:36.030
I've spent so long with you in Mount Wester.

30:36.440 --> 30:37.110
I know you better

30:37.110 --> 30:38.070
than you think.

30:37.360 --> 30:43.170
♫If the long night is too dark, I'll keep you company all the way♫

30:38.960 --> 30:40.270
When you have something weighing on you,

30:40.550 --> 30:41.920
you say things you don't mean.

30:42.550 --> 30:43.400
I won't believe

30:43.190 --> 30:48.290
♫To face all the love and hatred, the rights and wrongs♫

30:43.400 --> 30:44.960
a single word you say.

30:46.640 --> 30:48.240
Don't even think about pushing me away again.

30:48.580 --> 30:54.540
♫Our tortuous fate alternating endlessly between partings and reunions, joy and sorrow♫

30:49.550 --> 30:50.070
Master,

30:50.590 --> 30:51.880
you've never abandoned me,

30:52.510 --> 30:53.880
and I'll never abandon you either.

30:54.650 --> 30:59.850
♫Only after experiencing death and rebirth do you realize its preciousness♫

30:58.790 --> 31:00.310
Why is Master so badly injured?

30:59.870 --> 31:05.610
♫A destiny full of twists and turns, a love fraught with hardship♫

31:01.400 --> 31:02.160
Illusions…

31:03.070 --> 31:04.830
Master used illusions to hide his injuries.

31:05.740 --> 31:10.920
♫But I remain fearless with no regrets♫

31:06.510 --> 31:07.000
Master,

31:07.350 --> 31:08.350
let me heal your wounds.

31:11.310 --> 31:17.120
♫Waiting for the fallen flowers to dance and silhouettes to pair up♫

31:17.280 --> 31:23.750
♫Eventually nestling in each other's arms again♫

31:25.920 --> 31:26.920
Master,

31:27.030 --> 31:28.400
have a rest in the Qiankun Pouch.

31:37.200 --> 31:37.960
There's one left.

31:45.350 --> 31:46.240
Something feels off.

31:47.110 --> 31:47.680
Look around.

31:48.640 --> 31:49.720
There's not a single plant here.

31:54.640 --> 31:55.350
What's going on?

31:56.070 --> 31:56.830
It's the Devourer Bugs.

31:57.050 --> 31:58.320
Trapped in Heavenly Meridian Mountain

31:58.350 --> 31:59.220
with no power as food,

31:59.550 --> 32:01.190
they must be gnawing away at the mountain veins.

32:01.820 --> 32:02.790
That's horrifying.

32:03.780 --> 32:04.600
Those bugs

32:05.160 --> 32:06.590
were once a calamity in the Immortal Realm.

32:06.830 --> 32:08.350
It took everything the Immortal Realm had

32:08.590 --> 32:09.510
to wipe them out.

32:10.030 --> 32:11.350
Where did Master Mu get them?

32:12.550 --> 32:13.510
It couldn't be her.

32:13.750 --> 32:15.740
Devourer Bugs need to feed on

32:15.920 --> 32:16.920
corpses and blood for decades

32:17.160 --> 32:18.240
just to hatch.

32:18.790 --> 32:20.960
Mu Qingge was reborn less than two years ago.

32:21.480 --> 32:22.720
There's no way she could've raised them.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.790
What will happen if the mountain veins here

32:25.110 --> 32:26.270
are completely severed

32:26.720 --> 32:27.270
by those Devourer Bugs?

32:28.640 --> 32:29.640
Heavenly Meridian Mountain will collapse.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.640
We'll all be buried alive here.

32:38.160 --> 32:39.640
Let's find a way to escape together.

32:40.440 --> 32:41.550
Aren't you afraid I'll hurt you?

32:41.960 --> 32:43.370
If a man of your stature

32:43.750 --> 32:45.360
were to break his word at a time like this

32:45.440 --> 32:46.440
just to fight a junior,

32:47.350 --> 32:48.720
he'd be unworthy of his reputation.

33:00.000 --> 33:00.510
What are you doing?

33:00.920 --> 33:01.480
Let's go.

33:02.000 --> 33:03.590
That Vermilion Bird is suppressed by Heavenly Meridian Mountain

33:03.590 --> 33:04.640
and can't use its power.

33:05.020 --> 33:06.100
It's injured now.

33:06.440 --> 33:07.240
I have to save it.

33:08.350 --> 33:09.110
At a time like this,

33:09.240 --> 33:10.160
you're worried about a bird?

33:10.400 --> 33:11.310
If the Devourer Bugs find us,

33:11.310 --> 33:11.880
we're doomed!

33:29.840 --> 33:30.400
We're almost there.

33:30.960 --> 33:31.830
The mountain gate

33:32.070 --> 33:32.880
is just beyond this pass.

33:36.750 --> 33:37.790
What are you doing now?

33:37.960 --> 33:38.550
Let's go!

33:39.680 --> 33:40.590
We can't just leave like this.

33:41.270 --> 33:42.910
After the Devourer Bugs sever the mountain veins,

33:43.110 --> 33:44.550
they'll fly out and wreak havoc in the mortal world.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.400
By then, even though the mortal world is vast,

33:46.590 --> 33:47.790
there will be nowhere left to hide.

33:49.070 --> 33:50.200
Then let's hide while we can.

33:50.400 --> 33:51.440
Living one more day is better than dying now.

33:55.550 --> 33:56.310
The mountain veins are about to break.

33:56.480 --> 33:57.160
Spiritual energy is leaking.

33:57.350 --> 33:58.920
I'll use it to kill the Devourer Bugs.

33:58.940 --> 33:59.550
You leave first.

34:01.350 --> 34:02.000
You're crazy!

34:11.110 --> 34:12.440
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

34:30.120 --> 34:31.120
The mountain veins are severed.

34:31.190 --> 34:32.030
The restrictions are gone.

34:32.550 --> 34:34.000
Vermilion Bird, you can show your true form now!

34:40.239 --> 34:41.600
Why is the Mountain completely drained of spiritual energy?

34:41.630 --> 34:42.550
Why are the mountain veins all severed?

34:45.280 --> 34:46.280
The barrier is open.

34:46.510 --> 34:47.400
Let's go in and save them!

34:47.920 --> 34:48.330
Let's go!

34:53.000 --> 34:53.920
It must be Wei Jiu.

34:54.850 --> 34:55.630
What a tragedy.

34:55.630 --> 34:56.840
The disciples in there for training

34:57.070 --> 34:58.000
were all killed by that demon.

35:04.510 --> 35:05.590
You're still alive?

35:06.000 --> 35:06.710
You actually believe

35:06.710 --> 35:07.710
this woman's lies?

35:08.110 --> 35:09.190
She was the one who released the Devourer Bugs!

35:09.710 --> 35:10.150
Wei Jiu,

35:10.710 --> 35:11.840
don't pin the blame on someone else!

35:12.190 --> 35:12.960
Idiot!

35:13.600 --> 35:14.290
I snuck in

35:14.320 --> 35:15.590
for the power of the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

35:15.920 --> 35:17.400
Why would I destroy the Mountain?

35:17.710 --> 35:19.110
So many disciples have died,

35:19.400 --> 35:20.550
and you're still lying here.

35:21.110 --> 35:21.550
Everyone,

35:22.000 --> 35:23.210
let's kill this demon together!

35:23.420 --> 35:24.860
Let's avenge our disciples!

35:29.000 --> 35:30.000
Wei Jiu isn't lying.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.350
The havoc today

35:36.670 --> 35:38.000
was all Master Mu's doing.

35:39.710 --> 35:40.360
I thought

35:40.360 --> 35:41.770
you were just selfish.

35:41.880 --> 35:42.800
I never imagined

35:43.230 --> 35:44.710
you could be so malicious.

35:45.400 --> 35:46.280
Xue Ranran,

35:47.000 --> 35:48.440
why are you speaking such nonsense?

35:49.280 --> 35:50.000
Wei Jiu

35:50.400 --> 35:51.550
even managed to get into the Mountain.

35:52.070 --> 35:53.400
He's really great at dark magic.

35:53.970 --> 35:54.930
Xue Ranran must have

35:54.960 --> 35:56.190
fallen under his spell as well.

35:57.190 --> 35:58.710
But what Xue Ranran just put in her bag

35:59.000 --> 35:59.920
was the Vermilion Bird, right?

36:02.070 --> 36:03.630
With that divine bird with her,

36:03.940 --> 36:05.570
she couldn't possibly be under any evil spell.

36:11.560 --> 36:13.040
I'm so glad you're all safe.

36:14.760 --> 36:15.320
Master Mu

36:15.320 --> 36:16.760
released swarms of Devourer Bugs.

36:17.320 --> 36:18.550
We thought we were doomed.

36:19.030 --> 36:20.790
Luckily, you gave us plenty of talismans.

36:20.960 --> 36:22.480
We hid in the water all night

36:23.190 --> 36:24.550
and barely escaped with our lives.

36:25.110 --> 36:26.650
If not for Master Wen arriving in time,

36:26.760 --> 36:27.710
we wouldn't have survived.

36:28.240 --> 36:28.850
You didn't expect

36:28.880 --> 36:30.190
so many survivors, did you?

36:30.880 --> 36:31.920
You're a habitual liar.

36:32.320 --> 36:33.230
Are you still going to deny it?

36:36.030 --> 36:36.590
Yes,

36:36.880 --> 36:37.440
it was me.

36:38.480 --> 36:39.400
But do you think

36:39.400 --> 36:40.440
I wanted this to happen?

36:41.230 --> 36:41.880
Look at

36:42.400 --> 36:44.230
Xue Ranran and Wei Jiu's foreheads.

36:44.480 --> 36:45.110
What do you see?

36:46.320 --> 36:47.550
The spiritual mark of the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

36:48.280 --> 36:49.070
They both have it.

36:49.840 --> 36:51.010
The Pool has always

36:51.370 --> 36:52.640
allowed only one person to enter.

36:53.720 --> 36:55.660
But why did both Xue Ranran

36:55.840 --> 36:57.360
and Wei Jiu enter it?

36:57.800 --> 36:58.650
The Vermilion Bird

36:58.880 --> 36:59.960
was sealed by Dun Tian.

37:00.440 --> 37:02.110
Why did it follow Xue Ranran

37:02.360 --> 37:03.760
after the Mountain collapsed?

37:04.440 --> 37:05.840
It's because

37:06.320 --> 37:07.840
Xue Ranran and Wei Jiu have been conspiring

37:07.840 --> 37:08.800
from the start!

37:10.670 --> 37:11.400
Everyone, look.

37:14.490 --> 37:15.890
They used Resentment Liquid early on

37:15.920 --> 37:16.710
to control me.

37:17.360 --> 37:19.150
They forced me to obtain Devourer Bugs.

37:20.070 --> 37:22.000
Otherwise, how could I have such things

37:22.280 --> 37:23.670
so soon after my rebirth?

37:25.030 --> 37:26.030
This is all their

37:26.110 --> 37:28.110
elaborate scheme to deceive everyone.

37:28.920 --> 37:30.590
And now, they're trying to pin everything on me!

37:33.110 --> 37:34.150
Xue Ranran wouldn't do that!

37:36.870 --> 37:38.070
As for Ranran's identity,

37:38.630 --> 37:40.150
I hope that no matter when or what,

37:40.760 --> 37:42.110
you won't mention it to others.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.250
I have my own plans.

37:45.550 --> 37:46.280
I've said

37:46.800 --> 37:47.550
all there is to say.

37:48.320 --> 37:49.510
If you still don't believe me,

37:49.880 --> 37:51.000
then take my life.

37:51.550 --> 37:53.440
This is complex. It's hard to distinguish truth from lies.

37:53.920 --> 37:55.410
Let's put Xue Ranran, Wei Jiu,

37:55.840 --> 37:56.730
and Mu Qingge

37:57.210 --> 37:58.610
into the Bone-Scraping Tower

37:59.110 --> 38:00.320
for interrogation.

38:01.590 --> 38:02.480
Have you all gone mad?

38:03.060 --> 38:04.210
Based on a few words from this vicious woman,

38:04.390 --> 38:05.700
you're going to make Xue Ranran and me

38:06.000 --> 38:07.960
suffer the agony of shattered bones and burning souls?

38:09.360 --> 38:09.960
Everyone,

38:10.630 --> 38:12.000
if we judge others recklessly,

38:12.280 --> 38:13.360
how can we call ourselves righteous?

38:13.920 --> 38:14.510
Elder Wen,

38:15.510 --> 38:16.960
letting villains roam free

38:17.670 --> 38:18.880
is even less righteous.

38:19.440 --> 38:20.280
They just need

38:20.590 --> 38:21.760
to suffer a bit to prove their innocence.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.400
The truth will come out eventually.

38:24.280 --> 38:24.760
No!

38:25.550 --> 38:26.190
Elder Wen,

38:26.840 --> 38:27.920
don't worry about me.

38:28.280 --> 38:30.320
We won't accept this treatment without a fight.

38:32.040 --> 38:32.640
Fine.

38:33.480 --> 38:35.000
I'll just need to kill a few more people.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.440
You think you can take me down?

38:37.960 --> 38:38.510
Wei Jiu,

38:39.230 --> 38:40.230
do you really think

38:40.800 --> 38:42.480
we wouldn't take precautions for guarding

38:42.800 --> 38:44.110
the sacred Heavenly Meridian Mountain?

38:45.840 --> 38:46.400
Activate the formation!

38:50.370 --> 38:50.930
Everyone!

38:54.030 --> 38:55.150
The Annihilation Sword Formation!

39:16.510 --> 39:17.670
How dare you mess with the Westers!

39:18.190 --> 39:19.090
You must have a death wish!

39:19.450 --> 39:20.160
Master!

39:21.170 --> 39:22.290
Su Yishui!

39:22.400 --> 39:23.190
Su Yishui?

39:24.590 --> 39:26.150
Blame everything that happened today on me.

39:26.710 --> 39:27.800
Mount Wester is right here.

39:28.160 --> 39:29.010
Come anytime.

39:29.400 --> 39:30.400
I'll be waiting.

39:39.670 --> 39:40.710
Su Yishui

39:41.070 --> 39:42.110
is so powerful,

39:42.440 --> 39:44.070
suppressing the formation from thousands of miles away.

39:44.510 --> 39:45.880
How much spiritual power must that have cost?

39:47.110 --> 39:48.630
The Westers are all gone.

39:48.960 --> 39:50.070
Wei Jiu also escaped in the chaos.

39:52.140 --> 39:52.950
Where's Mu Qingge?

39:53.230 --> 39:54.800
Of course, she escaped with them.

40:24.590 --> 40:26.360
I made all these arrangements

40:26.770 --> 40:27.890
just to push you

40:27.920 --> 40:29.150
to this point.

40:29.960 --> 40:31.030
Your Ice Lotus Technique

40:31.440 --> 40:32.800
must have failed, right?

40:34.280 --> 40:35.670
The day of success

40:36.070 --> 40:37.440
is even closer now!

40:46.110 --> 40:46.880
Master is so powerful.

40:47.320 --> 40:48.400
I wonder how he managed

40:48.630 --> 40:49.190
to suppress

40:49.190 --> 40:50.320
that terrifying sword formation.

40:54.150 --> 40:54.630
Ranran,

40:55.230 --> 40:57.030
the spiritual mark on your forehead

40:57.280 --> 40:58.710
vanished as soon as we left Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

41:02.030 --> 41:02.920
I'll continue my seclusion.

41:03.350 --> 41:04.060
I'm leaving.

41:05.030 --> 41:05.630
Ranran!

41:13.670 --> 41:14.280
Master!

41:34.430 --> 41:36.220
I, Su Yishui, sovereign of Wester Sect,

41:36.880 --> 41:38.550
lift the restrictions on Xue Ranran,

41:39.230 --> 41:40.360
allow her to complete her training,

41:40.510 --> 41:41.510
and leave Mount Wester.

41:43.030 --> 41:44.070
From today on,

41:44.590 --> 41:45.760
in this vast world,

41:46.840 --> 41:48.000
she may come and go as she pleases.

41:51.480 --> 41:53.150
Master, you still want me to leave?

41:55.480 --> 41:56.480
The time has come.

41:59.440 --> 42:00.320
No matter what happens,

42:00.840 --> 42:01.590
I only want

42:01.590 --> 42:02.960
to stay by your side.

42:03.880 --> 42:06.110
Mount Wester is not a place where you can do

42:06.880 --> 42:08.360
whatever you want.

42:14.360 --> 42:15.110
Master…

42:16.710 --> 42:17.510
Leave now.

42:19.000 --> 42:19.630
Master!

42:45.400 --> 42:46.000
Ranran!

42:47.360 --> 42:48.230
Mr. Zeng,

42:48.680 --> 42:49.370
save Master!

42:49.400 --> 42:50.370
Please, save Master!

42:50.670 --> 42:52.320
He had split off a part of his soul to protect me,

42:52.550 --> 42:54.070
and just now he used the Soul Control Technique.

43:02.070 --> 43:02.550
Oh no.

43:03.400 --> 43:04.630
His condition is worse than I thought.

43:05.530 --> 43:06.330
The Ice Lotus in his body

43:06.360 --> 43:07.320
has completely shattered.

43:07.960 --> 43:08.590
The Ice Lotus?

43:10.760 --> 43:12.030
He sacrificed half of his Golden Core

43:12.280 --> 43:13.230
to nourish the Reincarnation Tree.

43:14.010 --> 43:15.330
So he had to practice the Ice Lotus Technique

43:15.360 --> 43:16.320
to repair his Golden Core.

43:17.230 --> 43:17.760
Now,

43:18.680 --> 43:19.560
with the Ice Lotus broken,

43:19.670 --> 43:21.150
that half of the Golden Core has also shattered.

43:21.920 --> 43:23.440
So he has fallen from the Transcendence Stage,

43:24.280 --> 43:25.360
and his power is unstable now.
